WEBVTT

00:02.080 --> 00:03.380
<b>A career guidance meeting?!</b>

00:02.380 --> 00:06.790
<b>Episode 7:  Daybreak</b>

00:03.630 --> 00:06.790
<b>Yeah, 'cuz we're third years now.</b>

00:06.790 --> 00:09.380
<b>I have mine this week as well.</b>

00:09.630 --> 00:11.000
<b>I'm so nervous.</b>

00:11.000 --> 00:13.630
<b>Not long before we lose our
"high school girl" status, huh?</b>

00:13.830 --> 00:15.790
<b>That's what you're worried about?</b>

00:16.130 --> 00:19.710
<b>I mean, it's a special period in life
that only lasts three years!</b>

00:20.000 --> 00:23.670
<b>I swear there must have been perks
I didn't even notice at the time.</b>

00:24.670 --> 00:26.500
<b>Have you decided what you want to do?</b>

00:27.750 --> 00:30.500
<b>Well, I guess I'll just go to university somewhere.</b>

00:31.670 --> 00:32.500
<b>I see.</b>

00:34.750 --> 00:39.040
<b>Though don't you think that kind of career guidance
is just a formality most of the time?</b>

00:39.460 --> 00:41.290
<b>I-I guess you might be right.</b>

00:41.290 --> 00:42.380
<b>What about you, Kiui?</b>

00:42.750 --> 00:43.540
<b>Me?</b>

00:43.830 --> 00:46.920
<b>I'm thinking of going to the School
of Education at Wasoda.</b>

00:49.250 --> 00:50.380
<b>Huh?!</b>

00:50.630 --> 00:52.130
<b>What? I never knew that!</b>

00:52.130 --> 00:53.420
<b>I never told you.</b>

00:53.920 --> 00:55.630
<b>Why the School of Education?</b>

00:55.630 --> 00:58.710
<b>Well, I want to be a middle school teacher.</b>

00:58.710 --> 00:59.460
<b>What?!</b>

00:59.460 --> 01:01.960
<b>You, a teacher? Sounds splendid!</b>

01:02.500 --> 01:04.580
<b>Since when did you decide that?</b>

01:05.290 --> 01:10.290
<b>Uh, since when? I mean, I have plenty
of time to think about stuff.</b>

01:10.630 --> 01:13.750
<b>But hey, can you actually graduate from high school?</b>

01:14.080 --> 01:18.540
<b>Nah. I won't meet the attendance requirements
so I've applied to take a certification exam.</b>

01:18.790 --> 01:24.170
<b>Based on taking past exam problems, I'd say I have
at the very least a 90% chance of passing.</b>

01:24.380 --> 01:29.170
<b>I'm planning on commuting by motorbike, so I might use
my time now to get a license. At a driver's ed camp.</b>

01:26.670 --> 01:29.380
<b>Miyamoto-Sakai</b>

01:26.670 --> 01:29.380
<b>Driving School</b>

01:26.670 --> 01:29.380
<b>Total support for getting a license</b>

01:29.710 --> 01:33.580
<b>I didn't know you had such a concrete plan, Kiui.</b>

01:34.170 --> 01:37.420
<b>Well, I'm planning on a path that deviates from the norm.</b>

01:37.920 --> 01:41.380
<b>I've gotta plan things properly
or I'm screwed for life, right?</b>

01:41.670 --> 01:43.130
<b>Screwed for life...</b>

01:44.670 --> 01:45.750
<b>You, Mei?</b>

01:45.750 --> 01:47.880
<b>University for me as well.</b>

01:47.880 --> 01:49.460
<b>My school's affiliated.</b>

01:49.750 --> 01:50.750
<b>I see...</b>

01:51.540 --> 01:57.000
<b>B-but you have your goal of getting
100k followers for JELEE, Nono-tan!</b>

01:57.880 --> 02:00.170
<b>Yeah, that's true!</b>

02:00.170 --> 02:01.880
<b>That's pretty much my career path.</b>

02:02.500 --> 02:05.710
<b>And so I have nothing left to pray for!</b>

02:10.080 --> 02:11.290
<b>Uh hey, Kiui!</b>

02:11.540 --> 02:12.420
<b>Huh?</b>

02:12.880 --> 02:15.830
<b>Can I tag along to your driver's ed camp?</b>

02:18.290 --> 02:23.210
<b>When will I be able to use magic?</b>

02:23.330 --> 02:28.130
<b>I've always longed for something special</b>

02:28.420 --> 02:33.290
<b>1, 2, 3, fall in line, B, C, D, eagerly obedient</b>

02:33.420 --> 02:38.880
<b>But I know best, that that's not me</b>

02:39.750 --> 02:45.460
<b>No one thinks this is ok the way it is</b>

02:45.460 --> 02:48.250
<b>Anxious legs weighing me down</b>

02:49.250 --> 02:52.920
<b>Even you, who I hold so close</b>

02:53.040 --> 02:57.630
<b>Being frustratingly out of reach, what I see is...</b>

02:57.880 --> 03:03.500
<b>A variety of colors, a myriad of brightness</b>

03:03.500 --> 03:08.540
<b>Even if I've been fed up countless times -resonating with you-</b>

03:08.750 --> 03:13.500
<b>Breaking through my thoughts that seem to be on a loop</b>

03:13.500 --> 03:18.130
<b>Mayday to these melancholic days, I dance in the air</b>

03:18.130 --> 03:22.790
<b>Taking a bite out of the gloomy sky</b>

03:22.960 --> 03:30.750
<b>There's an unexpected sweetness, amidst the bitter, sour, salty taste</b>

03:33.080 --> 03:39.830
<b>I'm moving towards where the light shines</b>

03:51.040 --> 03:51.540
<b>Ouch!</b>

03:52.210 --> 03:52.920
<b>Huh?</b>

03:52.920 --> 03:54.580
<b>C'mon, class is over.</b>

03:56.420 --> 03:57.080
<b>Oh.</b>

03:58.420 --> 03:59.790
<b>Get Product Here</b>

04:00.130 --> 04:03.250
<b>You know, what's with all the classes here?!</b>

04:03.040 --> 04:09.670
<b>Miyamoto-Sakai</b>

04:03.040 --> 04:09.670
<b>Driving</b>

04:03.040 --> 04:09.670
<b>School</b>

04:03.380 --> 04:06.960
<b>It's only the second day, and we have
four straight hours in the classroom!</b>

04:07.170 --> 04:09.380
<b>Uh, you slept through most of it.</b>

04:11.040 --> 04:13.250
<b>I just wanna get on a motorbike already!</b>

04:15.460 --> 04:19.710
<b>But hey, why did you decide to get a license, anyway?</b>

04:20.080 --> 04:20.670
<b>Huh?</b>

04:21.460 --> 04:23.630
<b>Hmm, I dunno...</b>

04:25.040 --> 04:26.710
<b>Just a whim, I guess?</b>

04:29.170 --> 04:31.500
<b>Hey, let's go take a PikPok video over there.</b>

04:30.460 --> 04:33.460
<b>Nono-tan's spending nights together with Miss Kiui...</b>

04:31.500 --> 04:32.790
<b>Sure, sounds good.</b>

04:34.080 --> 04:35.710
<b>My heart. It hurts!</b>

04:37.080 --> 04:39.580
<b>You don't have to worry that much.</b>

04:39.710 --> 04:41.250
<b>H-how can I not?!</b>

04:47.080 --> 04:49.210
<b>It's hard not to worry when you're alone, huh?</b>

04:49.750 --> 04:51.040
<b>It'll be okay.</b>

04:52.580 --> 04:53.710
<b>Miss Mahiru...</b>

04:54.580 --> 04:56.210
<b>You're like a mom!</b>

04:56.210 --> 04:58.210
<b>I'm still in high school for the moment!</b>

04:59.790 --> 05:04.540
<b>Hey, Mei? Are you aiming to become
a professional pianist?</b>

05:05.540 --> 05:07.540
<b>Yes. That's the plan.</b>

05:07.540 --> 05:09.170
<b>Wow, you didn't even hesitate.</b>

05:09.830 --> 05:16.040
<b>A little while ago, there was a time
when I was unsure why I keep playing.</b>

05:18.170 --> 05:20.210
<b>But I was given a reason to keep playing.</b>

05:21.960 --> 05:23.630
<b>Ah, I see.</b>

05:23.920 --> 05:25.580
<b>Um, what about you?</b>

05:27.210 --> 05:30.790
<b>Are you going to be an illustrator someday, Miss Mahiru?</b>

05:32.880 --> 05:37.080
<b>To be honest, I haven't decided on
anything that concrete yet.</b>

05:37.630 --> 05:40.670
<b>Drawing for me was tough for a long time.</b>

05:41.210 --> 05:41.920
<b>But...</b>

05:47.130 --> 05:49.670
<b>...it's been getting more fun recently.</b>

05:50.380 --> 05:52.670
<b>I think I understand what you mean.</b>

05:53.540 --> 05:55.960
<b>Probably thanks to the same someone.</b>

05:55.960 --> 05:56.920
<b>Exactly.</b>

05:57.130 --> 06:00.710
<b>She pulls us all along and we cherish her.</b>

06:03.630 --> 06:04.380
<b>Are you all right?</b>

06:04.380 --> 06:05.000
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:06.380 --> 06:07.380
<b>Here we go.</b>

06:08.130 --> 06:08.830
<b>Oof.</b>

06:19.960 --> 06:21.710
<b>You've gotten the hang of this already?</b>

06:21.710 --> 06:24.000
<b>You open up the throttle too much, Kano.</b>

06:24.330 --> 06:25.670
<b>But I mean...</b>

06:26.040 --> 06:26.920
<b>Oops.</b>

06:31.960 --> 06:32.920
<b>Slow it down!</b>

06:32.920 --> 06:34.130
<b>Keep your eyes ahead!</b>

06:35.830 --> 06:37.040
<b>What is she doing?</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:40.330
<b>Looks like your friend's having trouble
with the balance beam.</b>

06:41.420 --> 06:42.580
<b>You got a light?</b>

06:43.000 --> 06:44.750
<b>Oh, I don't smoke.</b>

06:45.210 --> 06:47.330
<b>No? I think it would fit your style.</b>

06:47.750 --> 06:49.250
<b>You'd be more in demand.</b>

06:50.330 --> 06:54.000
<b>You mean in a selective cult following way, don't you?</b>

07:01.960 --> 07:03.250
<b>I thought you were going to smoke.</b>

07:06.710 --> 07:09.830
<b>You seem more interesting than having a smoke.</b>

07:10.380 --> 07:11.710
<b>Uh, okay...</b>

07:14.330 --> 07:15.250
<b>What?</b>

07:18.130 --> 07:19.130
<b>How big are your boobs?</b>

07:19.130 --> 07:20.540
<b>Okay, I'm going.</b>

07:20.790 --> 07:22.630
<b>Aww, sorry, my bad!</b>

07:23.630 --> 07:25.830
<b>What? You've done Fuisora?!</b>

07:27.130 --> 07:28.920
<b>Well, it's a popular one.</b>

07:29.330 --> 07:32.040
<b>Does that mean you have
Song of Maya under your belt too?</b>

07:32.250 --> 07:37.750
<b>Yup. People say that one's psychotic,
but the underlying plot's pretty classic, isn't it?</b>

07:38.170 --> 07:41.790
<b>Uh, you think? Are you one of those contrary-type otaku?</b>

07:41.790 --> 07:43.960
<b>It's an honest opinion from a majority standpoint.</b>

07:44.250 --> 07:48.080
<b>I see. That must mean you're just fundamentally twisted.</b>

07:48.540 --> 07:50.290
<b>Bet you don't have a lot of friends, huh?</b>

07:50.630 --> 07:54.750
<b>It's just my social circle isn't diluted
with superficial friendships.</b>

07:57.330 --> 08:01.210
<b>You know, I really like you! So, what's your name-</b>

08:01.210 --> 08:05.830
<b>Kiui! I never made it across
the balance beam, not even once!</b>

08:06.130 --> 08:07.290
<b>Hey, welcome back.</b>

08:07.580 --> 08:09.330
<b>Ooh! That looks so good!</b>

08:10.630 --> 08:12.040
<b>I order over there, right?</b>

08:12.420 --> 08:13.040
<b>That's right.</b>

08:14.750 --> 08:16.040
<b>So your name's Kiui.</b>

08:16.380 --> 08:17.960
<b>Uh, yeah.</b>

08:18.960 --> 08:20.000
<b>Umm...</b>

08:20.000 --> 08:20.880
<b>Koharu.</b>

08:20.880 --> 08:21.460
<b>Huh?</b>

08:22.130 --> 08:24.460
<b>My name. It's Koharu.</b>

08:27.790 --> 08:29.920
<b>Maan, I'm exhausted!</b>

08:30.170 --> 08:33.920
<b>I never did make it across the balance beam.</b>

08:34.380 --> 08:35.920
<b>Oh, don't get so down about it.</b>

08:35.920 --> 08:38.460
<b>You just aren't cut out for the balance beam.</b>

08:38.460 --> 08:40.460
<b>That doesn't make me feel better at all!</b>

08:44.500 --> 08:45.710
<b>You still awake?</b>

08:46.710 --> 08:48.830
<b>Well, us NEETs tend to be nocturnal.</b>

08:49.580 --> 08:52.000
<b>You don't have to be so cynical.</b>

08:53.290 --> 08:57.920
<b>Can I ask? Why did you decide
you want to be a school teacher?</b>

08:59.380 --> 09:01.040
<b>Uh, but if you don't wanna answer-</b>

09:01.500 --> 09:03.830
<b>Well, you know how I don't go to school?</b>

09:06.830 --> 09:09.500
<b>As a fact. I'm not being cynical.</b>

09:10.750 --> 09:12.750
<b>Right, yeah. Same here.</b>

09:16.250 --> 09:20.460
<b>When I was in middle school and
started having trouble fitting in,</b>

09:20.880 --> 09:23.380
<b>my homeroom teacher wanted a word with me.</b>

09:23.880 --> 09:28.540
<b>Watase. Kids normally grow out of
this kind of stuff in elementary school.</b>

09:29.380 --> 09:34.540
<b>That's when I realized, "I see. So I'm not normal."</b>

09:35.630 --> 09:39.960
<b>And then suddenly I was afraid of school...
and everything else.</b>

09:43.540 --> 09:44.540
<b>I see.</b>

09:44.960 --> 09:46.960
<b>Well, now I know what I'd say.</b>

09:47.460 --> 09:48.960
<b>What does normal even mean?!</b>

09:49.290 --> 09:52.420
<b>That's just some rule grownups made up!</b>

09:52.420 --> 09:54.330
<b>You know, like a punk band.</b>

09:56.380 --> 09:57.670
<b>Yeah, you'd totally say that.</b>

09:59.130 --> 10:00.580
<b>And so I thought...</b>

10:01.420 --> 10:06.790
<b>...maybe I could at least be there for the students
who end up alone, you know?</b>

10:07.750 --> 10:10.540
<b>Uh, sorry. Maybe that sounds pretentious.</b>

10:11.750 --> 10:15.580
<b>More than that, though, I just want
to feel like I managed to rescue</b>

10:16.250 --> 10:21.330
<b>the weak old me, who failed
to stand up to the world back then.</b>

10:22.960 --> 10:23.830
<b>I know what you mean!</b>

10:25.000 --> 10:27.040
<b>Huh? Wh-what's up?</b>

10:28.670 --> 10:29.420
<b>Kiui!</b>

10:30.500 --> 10:31.960
<b>Wh-what?</b>

10:32.670 --> 10:34.670
<b>Kiui, you're not alone anymore!</b>

10:37.920 --> 10:39.000
<b>Uh, okay.</b>

10:39.670 --> 10:41.540
<b>What?! That's pretty curt-</b>

10:41.540 --> 10:42.210
<b>Aaagh!</b>

10:45.580 --> 10:48.710
<b>Ooh, ow, ow, ow!</b>

10:47.670 --> 10:49.000
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:49.960 --> 10:50.750
<b>Huh?</b>

10:50.750 --> 10:53.250
<b>N-never mind. So what about you, huh?</b>

10:53.540 --> 10:55.710
<b>Why is your goal getting 100k followers?</b>

10:55.710 --> 10:57.750
<b>What? Now we're talking about me?</b>

10:57.750 --> 10:59.960
<b>Well, yeah. Now it's your turn.</b>

11:01.000 --> 11:02.790
<b>Fine, I guess so.</b>

11:03.330 --> 11:04.330
<b>Me...</b>

11:05.750 --> 11:07.250
<b>Well, I...</b>

11:10.420 --> 11:12.080
<b>I wonder why?</b>

11:21.130 --> 11:22.080
<b>Mmgh?</b>

11:22.630 --> 11:24.830
<b>Oh, sorry. Did I wake you up?</b>

11:25.170 --> 11:27.330
<b>That your uniform? Why?</b>

11:27.460 --> 11:30.170
<b>Umm, there's this thing I've got to do.</b>

11:32.830 --> 11:33.880
<b>"Thing"?</b>

11:33.880 --> 11:38.130
<b>Well, I have to get some documents
to take that certification exam.</b>

11:38.130 --> 11:38.630
<b>Uh?</b>

11:44.380 --> 11:46.040
<b>She's such a free spirit.</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:51.880
<b>Congratulations!</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:51.880
<b>82 accepted</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:51.880
<b>to medical school</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:51.880
<b>Congratulations!</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:51.880
<b>170 accepted</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:51.880
<b>to national/</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:51.880
<b>public universities</b>

11:49.920 --> 11:51.580
<b>Thank you... excuse me.</b>

11:51.880 --> 11:54.000
<b>High School Graduate Equivalency Certification Exam</b>

11:52.960 --> 11:56.460
<b>Anyway, I'm so worried about the practice exam,</b>

11:54.380 --> 11:55.080
<b>Got it.</b>

11:56.460 --> 11:57.630
<b>but our club advisor...</b>

11:57.630 --> 11:58.170
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

11:58.170 --> 12:00.380
<b>Hey, isn't that Watase?</b>

12:00.790 --> 12:02.670
<b>Do you think she's withdrawing from school?</b>

12:02.670 --> 12:04.750
<b>Whoa, actually? She's screwed!</b>

12:05.580 --> 12:07.000
<b>What does normal even mean?!</b>

12:07.000 --> 12:10.210
<b>That's just some rule grownups made up!</b>

12:11.540 --> 12:12.790
<b>So, the practice exams?</b>

12:12.790 --> 12:14.880
<b>Oh, it's not looking good at all.</b>

12:15.290 --> 12:16.540
<b>Especially English.</b>

12:17.670 --> 12:18.460
<b>U-uh...!</b>

12:18.460 --> 12:19.960
<b>Yeah, what about you?</b>

12:24.540 --> 12:25.920
<b>Tatekita High School</b>

12:33.420 --> 12:36.960
<b>Yeah, the world's still tough as ever.</b>

12:39.580 --> 12:41.080
<b>So, bra size?</b>

12:41.080 --> 12:42.630
<b>I've been wondering that, too.</b>

12:42.960 --> 12:44.080
<b>Not you too?</b>

12:45.290 --> 12:49.420
<b>And I mean, if you wanna ask someone something,
you should give your info first.</b>

12:49.880 --> 12:50.960
<b>I'm a C!</b>

12:50.960 --> 12:51.710
<b>Don't.</b>

12:51.710 --> 12:54.750
<b>Me next? I'm a former B who's an F now.</b>

12:55.080 --> 12:56.000
<b>"Former"?</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:58.250
<b>You mean you have implants?</b>

12:58.750 --> 13:00.710
<b>Yup. Actually...</b>

13:01.130 --> 13:03.330
<b>all of this is artificial.</b>

13:03.790 --> 13:04.580
<b>What?!</b>

13:04.580 --> 13:06.420
<b>Th-that's incredible.</b>

13:06.790 --> 13:10.040
<b>I have two-point sutures and epicanthoplasty here.</b>

13:10.460 --> 13:12.500
<b>A nasal septum extension graft here.</b>

13:13.500 --> 13:17.170
<b>And... I put a million yen into these.</b>

13:17.540 --> 13:18.580
<b>A million?!</b>

13:18.580 --> 13:21.670
<b>Miss Koharu, I'd love to join you for a bath tonight!</b>

13:21.960 --> 13:25.540
<b>Sure thing. Rather, I can just show you now.</b>

13:25.710 --> 13:26.750
<b>Ooh!</b>

13:28.210 --> 13:29.960
<b>I'm surrounded by weirdos.</b>

13:29.960 --> 13:31.960
<b>It's fine! Better weird than not.</b>

13:33.380 --> 13:35.670
<b>It beats being normal, right?</b>

13:37.670 --> 13:38.420
<b>Right.</b>

13:42.380 --> 13:45.750
<b>Hmm, could you give me a bit more of a smile?</b>

13:45.750 --> 13:46.380
<b>Oh.</b>

13:46.880 --> 13:48.330
<b>L-like this?</b>

13:51.500 --> 13:52.710
<b>Hey, Mei?</b>

13:53.040 --> 13:53.880
<b>Yes?</b>

13:53.880 --> 13:57.380
<b>You're learning to play piano at school, right?</b>

13:57.380 --> 13:58.670
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

13:59.500 --> 14:03.130
<b>Was that... how do I put this...</b>

14:03.540 --> 14:04.540
<b>Was it worth it?</b>

14:05.000 --> 14:07.460
<b>You mean going to school for piano?</b>

14:07.750 --> 14:09.290
<b>Oh, sorry. Don't move.</b>

14:09.290 --> 14:11.040
<b>Huh?! Oh...all right.</b>

14:13.790 --> 14:18.290
<b>You know how I generally have no interest in others?</b>

14:18.290 --> 14:20.710
<b>Yeah. All except for Kano.</b>

14:21.460 --> 14:23.420
<b>But I was wrong.</b>

14:23.420 --> 14:24.540
<b>Wrong?</b>

14:25.170 --> 14:28.380
<b>I was always top of my class in performance skills,</b>

14:28.380 --> 14:31.170
<b>but one time I came in second.</b>

14:31.580 --> 14:34.540
<b>Yes! The top grade! I got the top grade!</b>

14:34.540 --> 14:35.130
<b>Amazing!</b>

14:36.130 --> 14:38.380
<b>I surprised myself then.</b>

14:39.290 --> 14:41.960
<b>I realized I was actually upset.</b>

14:43.380 --> 14:49.040
<b>After that, I feel like I've been able
to truly engage in piano.</b>

14:50.210 --> 14:53.750
<b>I think I discovered a part of me I never knew I had.</b>

14:53.750 --> 14:54.500
<b>Oh!</b>

14:54.790 --> 14:56.580
<b>That's it! Hold that expression!</b>

14:56.580 --> 14:57.670
<b>A-all right!</b>

15:01.290 --> 15:02.750
<b>S-so these...</b>

15:02.750 --> 15:04.130
<b>...are a million yen!</b>

15:06.000 --> 15:07.580
<b>You're staring too much.</b>

15:08.000 --> 15:10.500
<b>Aren't Kiui's a tad bigger?</b>

15:10.830 --> 15:13.330
<b>If Miss Koharu's an F, that must mean...</b>

15:11.000 --> 15:11.670
<b>Wow.</b>

15:11.670 --> 15:12.710
<b>What do you think?</b>

15:12.920 --> 15:14.960
<b>They really cost you a million?</b>

15:15.500 --> 15:17.000
<b>Wanna try touching them?</b>

15:17.000 --> 15:18.210
<b>Are you sure?!</b>

15:19.540 --> 15:21.540
<b>Miss Koharu, these are amazing!</b>

15:21.540 --> 15:23.250
<b>Th-these are synthetic?!</b>

15:23.250 --> 15:24.250
<b>Uh, hey.</b>

15:27.210 --> 15:31.000
<b>They're both high school girls.
I really hope this isn't a crime.</b>

15:28.790 --> 15:30.960
<b>Art. It's basically art.</b>

15:34.830 --> 15:38.080
<b>Miss Koharu, do you have any advice for me?</b>

15:38.630 --> 15:41.920
<b>You mean for the balance beam? Or is this about boobs?</b>

15:41.920 --> 15:43.130
<b>The balance beam!</b>

15:43.670 --> 15:47.330
<b>Keep your eyes fixed on where you want to go.</b>

15:48.170 --> 15:52.080
<b>That stabilizes the bike and
lets you move straight forward.</b>

15:52.460 --> 15:55.330
<b>Huh... But isn't that scary?</b>

15:55.750 --> 15:59.170
<b>I keep looking down in front of me
because I'm scared of falling over.</b>

15:59.830 --> 16:04.330
<b>Well, looking ahead to where
you're going is pretty scary...</b>

16:06.210 --> 16:10.790
<b>But suddenly finding yourself in
an unknown place with no way to turn back</b>

16:11.380 --> 16:12.630
<b>is way more scary.</b>

16:17.960 --> 16:20.420
<b>Look ahead, look ahead, look ahead, look ahead!</b>

16:20.420 --> 16:21.960
<b>You've got this!</b>

16:22.460 --> 16:23.500
<b>Look ahead!</b>

16:33.500 --> 16:35.040
<b>She's good under pressure!</b>

16:36.210 --> 16:37.210
<b>Oh, wow.</b>

16:37.210 --> 16:38.880
<b>I did it!</b>

16:40.210 --> 16:41.290
<b>I'm so sorry.</b>

16:41.290 --> 16:42.630
<b>I failed the written portion.</b>

16:44.250 --> 16:46.250
<b>Really, Kano?</b>

16:47.960 --> 16:51.040
<b>Huh?! Nox? You mean Nox Ryugasaki?!</b>

16:51.420 --> 16:52.750
<b>"Goodbye world."</b>

16:52.750 --> 16:54.250
<b>Hey! That's embarrassing.</b>

16:55.670 --> 16:57.460
<b>But did you really want to tell me?</b>

16:57.460 --> 16:59.130
<b>Isn't that your alter ego?</b>

16:59.540 --> 17:01.830
<b>Well, I figure I can tell you.</b>

17:03.130 --> 17:04.040
<b>Mm-hm?</b>

17:06.420 --> 17:07.290
<b>Hey!</b>

17:08.040 --> 17:09.000
<b>What is it?</b>

17:09.580 --> 17:11.170
<b>Give me your contact info.</b>

17:12.000 --> 17:13.330
<b>Okay, sure.</b>

17:16.170 --> 17:17.130
<b>What's wrong?</b>

17:17.580 --> 17:20.580
<b>Usually, I'm the one who gets asked for info.</b>

17:21.130 --> 17:23.040
<b>Why's that a point of pride?</b>

17:24.920 --> 17:27.000
<b>You said you live in Ogikubo?</b>

17:27.170 --> 17:27.880
<b>Yep.</b>

17:28.250 --> 17:31.540
<b>I live in Shin-Okubo, so it's a flash
to get there on motorbike.</b>

17:31.540 --> 17:32.920
<b>Let's set together sometime soon.</b>

17:33.080 --> 17:35.290
<b>Well... I dunno.</b>

17:36.380 --> 17:41.170
<b>What? Did we not click as much as I thought?</b>

17:41.170 --> 17:41.750
<b>Huh?</b>

17:41.750 --> 17:45.080
<b>Uh, no. That's not the issue...</b>

17:46.040 --> 17:49.170
<b>Nox Ryugasaki</b>

17:46.080 --> 17:49.040
<b>Miss Koharu, do you play Exo by any chance?</b>

17:49.460 --> 17:51.130
<b>Huh? Sure I do.</b>

17:51.460 --> 17:54.170
<b>Oh, good. Then let's hang out online.</b>

17:54.460 --> 17:57.290
<b>Okay, but we live so close to each other. Why online?</b>

17:57.630 --> 18:00.130
<b>Well, I'm what you'd call indoorsy.</b>

18:00.500 --> 18:01.500
<b>Besides...</b>

18:03.670 --> 18:07.250
<b>Better fiber optic than by motorbike. It's way faster!</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:10.580
<b>Please discuss your post-graduation plans with a guardian and hand in the</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:10.580
<b>filled-in form by May 20th.</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:10.580
<b>1st Choice:   Miyamoto Art University, College of Art and Design, Department of Painting</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:10.580
<b>2nd Choice:   Toyoshiro-ou Art University, Department of Painting, Oil Painting Major</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:10.580
<b>3rd Choice:   Sainomiya Art University, Department of Art and Craft, Oil Painting Course</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:10.580
<b>Is it too late to try for an art university?</b>

18:12.380 --> 18:14.080
<b>Oh, there you are Mahiru.</b>

18:14.460 --> 18:16.960
<b>There's this place I want to
check out in Shibuya sometime.</b>

18:17.330 --> 18:18.210
<b>Okay!</b>

18:18.670 --> 18:20.460
<b>Driver</b>

18:18.670 --> 18:20.460
<b>License</b>

18:23.380 --> 18:25.710
<b>Yes!</b>

18:29.130 --> 18:31.500
<b>Please return the vehicle with a full tank of gas.</b>

18:31.920 --> 18:33.040
<b>Well then, drive safe!</b>

18:34.130 --> 18:35.630
<b>Where should I go?</b>

18:35.880 --> 18:39.630
<b>Search here</b>

18:44.630 --> 18:46.880
<b>There's nowhere in particular I wanna go!</b>

18:48.290 --> 18:49.380
<b>Huh?</b>

18:56.630 --> 18:58.630
<b>At Shibuya!</b>

18:56.630 --> 18:58.630
<b>Looks fun, right?</b>

18:56.630 --> 18:58.630
<b>Send to @KanoYamanouchi</b>

18:56.920 --> 18:58.130
<b>Think this'll go viral?</b>

18:58.130 --> 18:59.250
<b>What? Viral?</b>

18:59.250 --> 19:01.540
<b>Mahiru! This place was pretty tasty, right?</b>

19:01.540 --> 19:04.380
<b>Yeah! It was so worth coming, huh?</b>

19:04.380 --> 19:05.580
<b>Yoru!</b>

19:06.830 --> 19:08.500
<b>Did she just say "yoru"?</b>

19:06.830 --> 19:08.500
<b>Huh?! Kano?!</b>

19:08.710 --> 19:10.670
<b>And you're already riding a bike?!</b>

19:11.460 --> 19:13.290
<b>What? This is sudden!</b>

19:11.630 --> 19:12.290
<b>Who's that?</b>

19:12.290 --> 19:13.330
<b>Dunno.</b>

19:13.540 --> 19:15.880
<b>Well, uh...</b>

19:20.750 --> 19:21.630
<b>Kano!</b>

19:22.830 --> 19:24.170
<b>There we go.</b>

19:24.750 --> 19:25.380
<b>Uh?!</b>

19:26.250 --> 19:27.380
<b>C'mon, let's go!</b>

19:30.250 --> 19:31.080
<b>Hey?!</b>

19:31.380 --> 19:32.330
<b>What?</b>

19:32.750 --> 19:35.080
<b>Where should I be going?</b>

19:36.000 --> 19:37.420
<b>I don't know!</b>

19:37.420 --> 19:38.290
<b>What?</b>

19:39.380 --> 19:42.290
<b>But I mean, does it really matter?</b>

19:46.920 --> 19:48.000
<b>Guess not!</b>

19:48.710 --> 19:50.040
<b>Wherever, then!</b>

19:56.710 --> 19:59.250
<b>Whoa, it's so pretty!</b>

19:59.830 --> 20:02.830
<b>Amazing, huh? I haven't been to the ocean in ages.</b>

20:04.670 --> 20:07.170
<b>What did you decide for your future plans, Yoru?</b>

20:09.710 --> 20:12.630
<b>To go on to university. An art school.</b>

20:13.000 --> 20:14.500
<b>I'm going to take my chances.</b>

20:15.500 --> 20:16.460
<b>I see.</b>

20:17.710 --> 20:19.670
<b>You're all figuring stuff out.</b>

20:27.420 --> 20:28.710
<b>Why an art school?</b>

20:30.250 --> 20:33.380
<b>Well see, I want to like the art I draw.</b>

20:33.920 --> 20:34.880
<b>You did say that.</b>

20:35.750 --> 20:42.460
<b>But that's not all. I want to be able to draw much
more awesome art to make a certain someone happy.</b>

20:42.920 --> 20:44.790
<b>A certain someone?</b>

20:45.000 --> 20:47.330
<b>I never knew you had someone like that, Yoru.</b>

20:49.380 --> 20:52.000
<b>Yeah. I'm indebted to them, I guess.</b>

20:52.290 --> 20:56.460
<b>For showing me what I wanted to do when I was lost.</b>

20:56.920 --> 21:01.000
<b>And when my art improved, the person was
so thrilled as if it was their own achievement.</b>

21:02.210 --> 21:03.290
<b>You mean...</b>

21:04.580 --> 21:08.750
<b>Maybe I'm actually the type
who likes to reciprocate properly.</b>

21:10.880 --> 21:14.130
<b>Hey, why did you want to get a license, Kano?</b>

21:14.420 --> 21:16.330
<b>Is there somewhere you wanted to go?</b>

21:17.630 --> 21:20.330
<b>I suddenly realized I didn't know.</b>

21:21.040 --> 21:24.710
<b>Why I'm pressing on, and where I want to go.</b>

21:25.080 --> 21:28.790
<b>What did I want to do by aiming for 100k followers?</b>

21:30.380 --> 21:32.880
<b>Why do I want to sing?</b>

21:33.790 --> 21:35.710
<b>Why you want to sing, huh?</b>

21:37.750 --> 21:39.460
<b>Remember what you told me?</b>

21:41.040 --> 21:42.710
<b>Back when I couldn't draw.</b>

21:43.420 --> 21:46.130
<b>You said, "then draw for me."</b>

21:46.920 --> 21:47.710
<b>Yeah...</b>

21:49.040 --> 21:50.710
<b>So now it's my turn.</b>

21:51.130 --> 21:51.790
<b>Huh?</b>

21:53.420 --> 21:56.500
<b>Kano, say you'll sing for me!</b>

21:56.880 --> 22:00.130
<b>Because I really love your singing!</b>

22:04.170 --> 22:04.830
<b>Huh?</b>

22:05.250 --> 22:07.330
<b>Hey, look! A jellyfish!</b>

22:09.040 --> 22:10.540
<b>What? Really?</b>

22:11.540 --> 22:13.830
<b>Hey. Can I make a confession?</b>

22:13.830 --> 22:15.380
<b>Huh? What?</b>

22:14.330 --> 22:18.040
<b>The second hand won't stop, there's no time to be feeling down</b>

22:15.880 --> 22:19.580
<b>You know, I've always talked
about how much I love jellyfish...</b>

22:18.040 --> 22:26.580
<b>Every day is packed, a list full of things I want to do</b>

22:19.580 --> 22:20.420
<b>Yeah?</b>

22:21.880 --> 22:25.920
<b>But this is the first time in my life
I see a jellyfish out in the wild.</b>

22:26.790 --> 22:33.540
<b>Talking takes too long so I'll make it brief with a song</b>

22:26.920 --> 22:29.580
<b>Same here. It's a first for me, too.</b>

22:30.210 --> 22:31.040
<b>Let's go!</b>

22:31.040 --> 22:31.670
<b>Huh?</b>

22:33.750 --> 22:41.460
<b>Ever since that night I found you, the rhythm started accelerating</b>

22:43.830 --> 22:51.670
<b>Only having 24 hours in a day isn't nearly enough</b>

22:43.920 --> 22:46.420
<b>Hey! I think I figured it out!</b>

22:46.420 --> 22:47.540
<b>Figured what out?</b>

22:47.790 --> 22:49.130
<b>Why I got my license!</b>

22:50.830 --> 22:53.130
<b>I think it was to ride with you on the back, Mahiru!</b>

22:52.000 --> 22:58.670
<b>I haven't caught up to the night yet and morning's already coming</b>

22:58.790 --> 23:11.040
<b>Just one hour more would do, I want to gaze
on that moon, the same moon as yours</b>

23:01.670 --> 23:04.000
<b>What? That's a little heavy.</b>

23:04.000 --> 23:04.750
<b>Huh?!</b>

23:05.000 --> 23:07.920
<b>D-don't say that!</b>

23:08.460 --> 23:11.670
<b>And hey, did you just call me Mahiru and not Yoru?</b>

23:11.250 --> 23:17.920
<b>When I fell in love with the present that's ordinary
the future got a bit more vibrant</b>

23:11.960 --> 23:13.130
<b>Why's that?</b>

23:13.630 --> 23:16.460
<b>What? I just felt like it, okay?</b>

23:16.460 --> 23:18.130
<b>Oh come on, tell me!</b>

23:17.920 --> 23:23.460
<b>That's how I waited for tomorrow</b>

23:18.130 --> 23:20.330
<b>No reason. It felt right in the moment!</b>

23:20.330 --> 23:22.000
<b>Jeez.</b>

23:31.790 --> 23:35.420
<b>Listen, you can't have anyone ride with you
for the first year. Didn't you know that?</b>

23:35.670 --> 23:36.670
<b>I spaced...</b>

23:36.670 --> 23:37.750
<b>Okay, demerits for you.</b>

23:38.130 --> 23:39.670
<b>We're very sorry!</b>
